 "segments": [
  {
   "id": "seg-01",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Yesterday I met the team. Today Maria gives me my first job: copy the project code to my computer. I see the file. The folder is new to me. Maria asks me to clone a repository. I point to the local copy. Leo says, \"Could you help me?\" and I say, \"I need some help.\" I feel good today.",
   "tts": "Yesterday I met the team. Today Maria gives me my first job: copy the project code to my computer. I see the file. The folder is new to me. Maria asks me to clone a repository. I point to the local copy. Leo says, \"Could you help me?\" and I say, \"I need some help.\" I feel good today.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-01.mp3",
   "zh": "昨天我认识了团队。今天 Maria 给了我第一个任务：把项目代码复制到我的电脑上。我看到了文件。文件夹对我来说很新。Maria 让我克隆仓库。我指着本地副本。Leo说：\"你能帮帮我吗？\"我说：\"我需要一些帮助。\"我今天感觉很好。",
   "hard": [
    {
     "w": "file",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "文件，保存文字、图片或程序等内容的单位"
    },
    {
     "w": "folder",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "文件夹，用来分类存放文件"
    },
    {
     "w": "Could you help me?",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "你能帮帮我吗？"
    },
    {
     "w": "I need some help.",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "我需要一些帮助。"
    },
    {
     "w": "clone a repository",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "克隆仓库，把远程仓库完整复制到本地"
    },
    {
     "w": "local copy",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "本地副本，保存在自己电脑上的项目版本"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "seg-02",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "I need help, and I learn to ask for it. Maria smiles and says, \"Could you show me how?\" I answer, \"I don't understand yet.\" Maria shows me the file path. I point to the absolute path. I download the code. This is the remote repository. I learn one new thing.",
   "tts": "I need help, and I learn to ask for it. Maria smiles and says, \"Could you show me how?\" I answer, \"I don't understand yet.\" Maria shows me the file path. I point to the absolute path. I download the code. This is the remote repository. I learn one new thing.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-02.mp3",
   "zh": "我需要帮助，也学会了开口求助。Maria微笑着说：\"你能示范一下怎么做吗？\"我回答：\"我还没有理解。\"Maria 给我看了文件路径。我指着绝对路径。我下载代码。这是远程仓库。我学到了一件新东西。",
   "hard": [
    {
     "w": "file path",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "文件路径，表示文件所在位置的文字地址"
    },
    {
     "w": "absolute path",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "绝对路径，从系统根位置开始的完整地址"
    },
    {
     "w": "Could you show me how?",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "你能示范一下怎么做吗？"
    },
    {
     "w": "I don't understand yet.",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "我还没有理解。"
    },
    {
     "w": "download the code",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "下载代码，把代码文件保存到本地"
    },
    {
     "w": "remote repository",
     "type": "term",
     "def": "远程仓库，保存在 GitHub 等服务器上的仓库"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "seg-03",
   "spk": "Alex",
   "en": "Before I leave, I do one last thing. I see the clone URL. The default directory is new to me. Maria shows me the relative path. I point to the file extension. Leo says, \"Please say that again.\" and I say, \"Thank you for your help.\" The code is on my computer now. I feel ready for tomorrow.",
   "tts": "Before I leave, I do one last thing. I see the clone U R L. The default directory is new to me. Maria shows me the relative path. I point to the file extension. Leo says, \"Please say that again.\" and I say, \"Thank you for your help.\" The code is on my computer now. I feel ready for tomorrow.",
   "audio_file": "audio/seg-03.mp3",
   "zh": "离开前，我做最后一件事。我看到了克隆地址。默认目录对我来说很新。Maria 给我看了相对路径。我指着文件扩展名。Leo说：\"请再说一遍。\"我说：\"谢谢你的帮助。\"代码现在在我的电脑上了。我为明天做好了准备。",
   "hard": [
    {
